        "image_caption": "",
        "eyebrow": "Actually reclaimed",
        "heading": "Not made to look reclaimed.\nActually reclaimed.",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<p>Those knots, nail holes, sun-faded colors and imperfections aren't printed onto a manufactured board. They happened naturally over years of exposure.</p><p>We preserve the character. You decide where its next chapter goes.</p>",
