        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Darling Reclaimed started with an old idea, a new workshop and a family willing to bet on building something of their own.</p><p>For Nick and Erin Darling, reclaiming wood became about more than saving old material. It became a way to reclaim time, creativity and purpose.</p><p>Today, we rescue materials that would otherwise disappear and give them another chance to become something worth keeping.</p>"
          }
        },
